{"id":"vod_bf_13766","vodId":"13766","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"荒川爆笑团第一季","name_cn":"荒川爆笑团第一季","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-14/1658bc2145c8261ba39977c6eddeed43.jpg"},"summary":"大财团公子哥市之宫行（神谷浩史 配音）自由不知愁滋味，俨然叼着金汤匙出生的金贵少爷，就读于名门学府T大的他即将毕业，未来的人生一片光明，令人欣羡。他铭记市之宫家的家训“不求人，不欠人”，并以此为傲。可是现实的残酷却不得不令他拖欠人情，在开车通过荒川河时，他被几名少年抢走名贵跑车，裤子也被强行扒下挂在桥顶。强逞英雄的阿行爬桥不慎跌落水中，危急时刻被附近的少女小珊（坂本真绫 配音）救助。拖欠了人情的阿行答应作小珊的恋人，他极不情愿地随着这个自称金星人的少女留在荒川河床，并解释了在此生活的一对电波系怪人：河童村长、星星、武士、修女、铁人兄弟等。有趣怪诞的故事就此展开……　　本片根据中村光的同名漫画改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 17:59:14","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241022H78WQHeWindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241022UBS8mOY4index.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241022hJ5p1Cv1index.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241022HPQ2PgJ4index.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241022DlfByYtvindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241022yQ04mGuUindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241022HbrYazwgindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241022jzWmDlJLindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241022BYroRw0kindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241022aCT4dCCEindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replac